invariant: INV-16
file: quic.c
catches: quic_loop_host
reason: a Handshake packet ch_quic_open opens runs under the probe's bit alone, whatever
  the session's ch_cfg.cpu states, so no other bit picks a path there and
  its Poly1305 runs the decomposition. The packet is the same.
  test/quic_loop_widemul.h seals and opens a packet at each level each way
  and requires an end whose ch_cfg.cpu holds
  CH_CPU_CONSTANT_TIME_MULTIPLY to call no file under its own names.

--- old
        return quic_packet_open_handshake(CH_CFG_CPU(q->t.cfg), &q->handshake_rx,
--- new
        return quic_packet_open_handshake(CH_CPU_PROBED, &q->handshake_rx,
